1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,258
A breakout means more when the structure is already rising,

2
00:00:03,358 --> 00:00:05,379
and when a crowd turns up for it.

3
00:00:05,881 --> 00:00:11,080
Add three single signals: market structure, Bollinger position, and the heavy-volume candle.

4
00:00:11,737 --> 00:00:14,014
Line one: market structure is up.

5
00:00:14,114 --> 00:00:17,670
Line two: the close is at or above the upper Bollinger band.

6
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:20,986
Line three: today's volume is at least twice the usual.

7
00:00:30,971 --> 00:00:33,290
Save it, and run it on your equities.

8
00:00:48,877 --> 00:00:51,964
Yes means all three are true on today's finished candle.

9
00:00:52,064 --> 00:00:54,405
Each No shows which piece is missing.
